  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "Stephen Hawking is mapped as a potential donor for go-cart parts",
  "description": "The top text 'does anyone know if he had a donor card?' and the bottom text 'i need parts for my go-cart' together create an analogical mapping where Stephen Hawking (the visual entity) is implicitly equated with a 'donor' for spare parts. The meme humorously and disrespectfully projects the idea that Hawking's physical condition (due to ALS) makes him a source of parts for a go-cart, reducing his humanity to a physical commodity. This mapping is established through the juxtaposition of the text with the visual of Hawking in his wheelchair, which visually reinforces the absurd and offensive implication.",
